      "text": "To have a better view on how the frequencies BW and GBW are related to the lowfrequency gain, a Bode diagram is included. Such a Bode diagram consists of two diagrams, both versus frequency on a logarithmic scale. The top one shows the logarithm of the amplitude of the gain, denoted by |A |. The bottom v one plots the phase of the gain A . v It is clear that the GBW is indeed the product of A v0 and the BW. At the BW itself, the phase shift is −45°. At higher frequencies however, the phase shift increases to −90°."
